{"id":28396,"author":"xNemoII","body":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-d1b8f21e-e4a5-f1f7-6d11-6b718c89ab49\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eIGN: xNemoII\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDiscord( Name#): Nemo#0116\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eTimezone: BST\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhy would you like to join the referee team(brief paragraph): \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eI would like to become apart of the referee team because I want to be able assist and help the event staff team in any way I can. I've been apart of the competitive side of Avicus for a very long time now, and I have participated in a majority of the tournaments. Therefore, I have a lot of knowledge about Avicus tourneys and how they work and I want to be able to help make sure everything flows and works out like planned. In addition, I have also been apart of the community for years, and it would be awesome to be able to help out my fellow peers on the event staff team with planning and making sure all the matches go smoothly, but also my peers that are participating in the tourney too. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBest time of the week?: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWeekdays and Weekends. I have school on weekdays, however I am free after school. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eA paragraph or two to tell us something about yourself(Pretend you are trying to sell yourself to us):\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eLike previously stated above, I am an old Avicus player who has been apart of this server for years now. I have recently become A Moderator after being referred, and it made me realize that I enjoy helping others on the server when I get the chance. I spend a lot of my time playing football on a team and I've also had experience of being a referee for youth rugby matches. Being a referee for youth rugby matches taught me the skills that are needed to oversee matches and make sure everything goes accordingly. Furthermore, being apart of a football team has taught me the importance of teamwork, and how sometimes it is important to work with others and rely on eachother. Furthermore, I have always loved the competitive side of Avicus and I want to be able to get more involved and help in anyway I can.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAnything else?: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThanks for reading.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAny questions you may have can be directed towards any of the officials. Thank you and good luck!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-d1b8f21e-e4a5-f1f7-6d11-6b718c89ab49\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eIGN: xNemoII\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr class=\"kix-line-break\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; vertical-